source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input dm: date

move ml[x in [3, 2]]: transfers
  on dm
  leg cash from world to sav amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "s"
  dm = 2026-03-31 "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: flows(ml[3], 2026-03)
,,1:0,51:q: 10.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: ml[3]
  cut 2026-04-25
